<title>USA: Hibernia completes merger with Texarkana.</title>
<headline>Hibernia completes merger with Texarkana.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hibernia Corp said Tuesday that Hibernia National Bank completed its merger with Texarkana National Bancshares, parent of Texarkana National Bank.</p>
<p>The merger gives Hibernia a strong deposit market share in &quot;an important east Texas region&quot; that adds to its already &quot;strong and growing presence&quot; in northwest Louisiana, the company said in a release.</p>
<p>The Texarkana National name will change to Hibernia National Bank of Texas, the company added.</p>
